# Scope for graphify (knowledge-graph tool). Gitignore syntax; read on top of
# .gitignore, so it can only exclude MORE, never re-include anything.
#
# The graph is meant to describe the codebase and its documentation. These
# patterns remove what would duplicate or drown that signal.

# Images: photos, WebP twins and width variants from tools/optimize-images.php,
# icons. No structure to extract, and each one would cost its own vision pass.
*.webp
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
*.svg
public/admin/uploads/

# Annual-report PDFs: programme content rather than code or architecture.
*.pdf

# One-off scratch diffs.
extras/*.txt
